@startuml
title Target sale journey - persisted simulations
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
actor Buyer
actor Seller
actor Inspector
actor Courier
participant "Android app" as App
participant "FastAPI" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Private Storage" as Storage

Buyer -> App : browse guest / login when buying
App -> API : quote / create Order
API -> DB : reserve stock and immutable quote/address
Buyer -> App : simulated payment
App -> API : stable idempotent payment command
API -> DB : successful Payment + Receipt + HELD once
Seller -> API : save validated return address / ship center
API -> DB : freeze Seller snapshot / TO_CENTER
Courier -> API : upload / confirm assigned center proof
API -> Storage : private validated objects
Inspector -> API : canonical center receive / final PASS
API -> DB : transaction: result + certificate + RESULT_NOTIFIED
API --> Buyer : authorized result + public QR
Buyer -> API : CONFIRM inspection result
API -> DB : one immutable Buyer decision
Inspector -> API : create server-derived TO_BUYER
Courier -> API : upload / confirm selected delivery proof
API -> Storage : verify selected objects remain readable
API -> DB : DELIVERED_PENDING_BUYER + deadline=proof time+72h
Buyer -> API : confirm physical receipt (stable key)
API -> DB : lock Order; fresh DB clock; verify eligibility
API -> DB : atomic RELEASE + COMPLETED + SOLD
API --> Buyer : committed settlement / original receipt
API --> Seller : recorded simulated payout
Buyer -> API : seller rating + optional comment
API -> DB : unique completed-Order review
note over API,DB
  Worker may release after the same eligible receipt deadline,
  only without a timely non-receipt report and with readable proof.
  No provider bank transfer or automatic inspection decision.
end note
@enduml
